ish.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":16,"t":"Chapter 15.-Perseverance is Given to the End.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":17,"t":"Chapter 16.-Whosoever Do Not Persevere are Not Distinguished from the Mass of Perdition by Predestination.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":18,"t":"Chapter 17 [VIII.]-Why Perseverance Should Be Given to One and Not Another is Inscrutable.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":19,"t":"Chapter 18.-Some Instances of God's Amazing Judgments.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":20,"t":"Chapter 19.-God's Ways Past Finding Out.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":21,"t":"Chapter 20 [IX.]-Some are Children of God According to Grace Temporally Received, Some According to God's Eternal Foreknowledge.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":22,"t":"Chapter 21.-Who May Be Understood as Given to Christ.","c":0,"path":["