":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":37,"t":"Chapter 36.-God Not Only Foreknows that Men Will Be Good, But Himself Makes Them So.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":38,"t":"Chapter 37.-To a Sound Will is Committed the Power of Persevering or of Not Persevering.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":39,"t":"Chapter 38.-What is the Nature of the Gift of Perseverance that is Now Given to the Saints.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":40,"t":"Chapter 39 [XIII.]-The Number of the Predestinated is Certain and Defined.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":41,"t":"Chapter 40.-No One is Certain and Secure of His Own Predestination and Salvation.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":42,"t":"Chapter 41.-Even in Judgment God's Mercy Will Be Necessary to Us.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":43,"t":"Chapter 42.-The Reprobate are to Be Punished for Merits of a Different Kind.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":44,"t":"Chapter 43 [XIV.]-Rebuke and Grace Do Not Set Aside One Another.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":45,"t":"Chapter 44.-In What Way God Wills All Men to Be Saved.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":46,"t":"Chapter 45.-Scriptural Instances Wherein It is Proved that God Has Men's Wills More in His Power Than They Themselves Have.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":47,"t":"Chapter 46 [XV.]-Rebuke Must Be Varied According to the Variety of Faults. There is No Punishment in the Church Greater Than Excommunication.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":48,"t":"Chapter 47.-Another Interpretation of the Apostolic Passage, \"Who Will Have All Men to Be Saved.\"","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":49,"t":"Chapter 48.-The Purpose of Rebuke.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"},{"n":50,"t":"Chapter 49.-Conclusion.","c":0,"path":["Treatise on Rebuke and Grace"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Treatise%20on%20Rebuke%20and%20Grace.html"}]}
